{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓星宋慧喬再拋震撼彈！韓媒6月26日爆料，她將在合作長達14年的經紀公司UAA（United Artist Agency）合約到期後正式離開，並親自成立一人經紀公司，全面掌握演藝事業。</p><p>據韓媒報導，演藝圈相關人士透露，宋慧喬結束與UAA的合作後，將以個人工作室形式重新出發，而多年來陪伴她打拚的造型師等核心工作人員，也將一同加入新團隊，成為她獨立門戶後最堅強的後盾。</p><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（Instagram@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147226160308948992670982.jpeg/oeaytUUiSLZ6oj-VEZWqLwJT_92myKbkRtVanUbVWp0\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（Instagram@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><p>更多宋慧喬的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798282935209984970542.jpeg/iR6N3u_QWVI5gmeHOb-5ALgw-9APp6JsrJmtkayZrZE\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798280615628800169520.jpeg/2c-O24IE7sBm94gcvZBkDYYnoU28F12C6r9K2Oq_Stg\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798281320402944863910.jpeg/fCNp9L_LTsnYXhu2bWtjEDKvZGAxD_nF-nMSdfpzEnU\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798282293481472372068.jpeg/hk_GH6eMIqnq4ely-kIJGZG1lSQclZNzRxQtdkcULXY\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798280796114944138742.jpeg/_1T952JigceGFXP_DK_ZPNDxmz1234mlU7v8fVO7_H0\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798280036814848120586.jpeg/4HmAoyVZT8tBfhrfCA93LV-DjRmloD_mehFCqHoRQqg\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798277612376064615274.jpeg/LmWWykZf-1H1ffGth-aCKgn1vVJfqbSQuh494boePeE\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798277151002624095278.jpeg/48A4fn0SU-A3_qdYaGm4xSBo4O6A4gGZvs65Tb7OuU0\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798278312824832984036.jpeg/WjmD8kBRWr4hY6hmpyY2bdeI0QtDH7VstLRLebS0S3k\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798276605612032081459.jpeg/J3jcMWb-9qcC9gu7-1ICY3QDge990pwxUXjkjFF45Iw\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798279588024320915734.jpeg/jy1NDDkWoVSDdRLeAlUJox4YCL7i1t1lGpT7QRqU-0E\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798279252480000263987.jpeg/5akKEvxTVWqtLd2XQKLnfcnfszdcBBpJM0KqUDNCqlA\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798276353953792468375.jpeg/J4tJN06g2Utw7X6dqXmx2HpVop2kk7ePW_Ln6Fvy5-g\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798278795169792328407.jpeg/NpR5AjmsMCGT9Y-Eb2PnbnmphGrZ5nGz-lPF2PpTxdg\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798273233260544235978.jpeg/SG8uzhPxpS2les0HVaOLNw6f_911cM-5t6whabesIWk\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798275582201856042691.jpeg/xibVlEEzpmvRgNnGlX41-LmujIUQjNLyy02nsctNp7E\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798273531056128372456.jpeg/4B9BIqYtD_sxPeAtw_XzYRbQXEXJ6T4qiAUJW4gFCVs\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955798272453120000723650.jpeg/6iG7udAhQfKmdCu35A0oRL3B3O2vEO_V7TqhIO06oSA\"/><figcaption>宋慧喬（IG@kyo1122）</figcaption></figure><p>宋慧喬自2012年UAA成立時便簽約加入，不僅是公司首位簽約藝人，更是旗下最具代表性的招牌女星。她與公司代表朴賢貞合作多年，從經紀人一路成為事業夥伴，如今14年合作畫下句點，也讓不少粉絲感到意外。</p><p>近年宋慧喬憑藉《黑暗榮耀》再創演藝高峰，人氣席捲全球，戲約、代言接不停。如今選擇在事業巔峰時刻自立門戶，也被外界解讀是希望進一步掌握未來發展方向，開啟演藝生涯全新篇章。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：韓國「第一代網紅」李珠熙驟逝　過世前幾日還在與老公、女兒互動】李珠熙（이주희）（IG@aav_chloelee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147169014473035776216793.jpeg/DXMD4lCzsWUTyCXM8C9nAKHVgz4xY8PrdLUJMXS1CTE\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：韓國「第一代網紅」李珠熙驟逝　過世前幾日還在與老公、女兒互動】李珠熙（이주희）（IG@aav_chloelee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李珠熙（이주희）兩天前才更新社群分享生活，沒想到如今突傳離世，享年44歲。（IG@aav_chloelee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147169232463990784589137.jpeg/PPDKO3ZKfufwuyMYhyG2x1rVODa6-UVEIUFMkCFBTJA\"/><figcaption>李珠熙（이주희）兩天前才更新社群分享生活，沒想到如今突傳離世，享年44歲。（IG@aav_chloelee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李珠熙（이주희）早年靠著社群平台累積高人氣，被譽為韓國「第一代網紅」，之後創立時尚品牌，從網路人氣人物成功轉型為品牌經營者。（IG@aav_chloelee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147169225358446592413820.jpeg/ssQquEcfV8GCbgQkifi3wSW9FU5PjZTwjXxFGo18RRo\"/><figcaption>李珠熙（이주희）早年靠著社群平台累積高人氣，被譽為韓國「第一代網紅」，之後創立時尚品牌，從網路人氣人物成功轉型為品牌經營者。（IG@aav_chloelee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李珠熙（이주희）過世前2日還在與老公互動。（IG@aav_chloelee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147172081872408576970365.jpeg/HkV2Pms9hzwNHAG8LDrPGu61ETxbbJvBR3q0g0d6tIM\"/><figcaption>李珠熙（이주희）過世前2日還在與老公互動。（IG@aav_chloelee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李珠熙（이주희）過世前5日還在與女兒互動。（IG@aav_chloelee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147169230362513408861590.jpeg/g-istviVh5Onrt0sNBbSaAG8h9Mt8s01SeRUhknkVIY\"/><figcaption>李珠熙（이주희）過世前5日還在與女兒互動。（IG@aav_chloelee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李珠熙（이주희）（IG@aav_chloelee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147169231108968448417803.jpeg/4GLVJjDsOjEY_awADfm0pF9inGW6WiYwEgCTZhIAk2Y\"/><figcaption>李珠熙（이주희）（IG@aav_chloelee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李珠熙（이주희）（IG@aav_chloelee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147169236012371968068735.jpeg/OqR6cH3fU5XHY71Sg24jq0PbTrYam1UsuHNO1rhzTtY\"/><figcaption>李珠熙（이주희）（IG@aav_chloelee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李珠熙（이주희）（IG@aav_chloelee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147169228265230336730845.jpeg/hL4wlx47_sIfnZvYa67Mfix8R6M_MFqm-UdJHPlHSRw\"/><figcaption>李珠熙（이주희）（IG@aav_chloelee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李珠熙（이주희）（IG@aav_chloelee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147169228655169536429853.jpeg/mHjpzcLA6aK44CcyBI7ObLWZnCx5of5J350eaN-dHmg\"/><figcaption>李珠熙（이주희）（IG@aav_chloelee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李珠熙（이주희）（IG@aav_chloelee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147169233239805952658124.jpeg/tplRmR_On8wO2-0bsc-Y6iwu8RynLODd6JCmKOiQpig\"/><figcaption>李珠熙（이주희）（IG@aav_chloelee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李珠熙（이주희）（IG@aav_chloelee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147169238227095552812073.jpeg/85JulIvjnDsNa3dvjwNIwwztlfYmFbJANE3yhzRN8oc\"/><figcaption>李珠熙（이주희）（IG@aav_chloelee）</figcaption></figure><p>大谷翔平14個月生二胎！連晨翔曝劉品言產後仍在痛：當然有避孕</p><p>52歲蘇有朋巴黎街頭被捕獲！濃妝造型大翻車 網驚：認不出來</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-26T10:41:07.979745+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1199,"images":30,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}